WEBVTT

00:08:27.276 --> 00:08:32.476
This year, I changed my job title
to “Chief Solutionist”.

00:08:33.356 --> 00:08:38.196
I changed it to constantly remind myself
of the job that needs doing.

00:08:38.996 --> 00:08:42.156
Because as an X industry leader myself,

00:08:42.156 --> 00:08:45.036
I can either serve
the solutions every day,

00:08:45.036 --> 00:08:46.276
or by default,

00:08:46.276 --> 00:08:47.476
I’m serving destruction.

00:08:47.716 --> 00:08:49.356
There is no middle ground here.

00:08:49.356 --> 00:08:52.716
There must be no
carefully worded rationales.

00:08:52.716 --> 00:08:57.196
And the X industry can no longer pretend
it can remain neutral.

00:08:58.516 --> 00:09:02.076
Now if we do that,